 ("Are detention charges counted on weekends?", "Yes. Maersk's Pakistan advisory says free time and detention are counted in calendar days, including weekends."),
 ("Can I get demurrage refunded if customs caused the delay?", "Section 14A(2) of the Customs Act requires port and terminal operators to accept a delay and detention certificate from an Assistant Collector or above and refund demurrage for delays that were not your fault."),
